window.products.push({"id":360272,"name":"Home-X Christmas Tree Ornament S-Hooks, Elegant Party Decoration Hangers, Stainless Steel Christmas Ornament Perfect for Christmas Tree Decorations-Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g3luwmsiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for the best way to hang your Christmas ornaments? These gorgeous silver spiral S-hooks are a perfect solution! This set of 100 is great to keep on hand to replace broken hooks, add hooks to new ornaments, or hang other holiday items around your home. Their simple yet elegant design matches perfectly with virtually all holiday colors, including green, red, white, silver, and gold. They will look beautiful hanging on your tree, no matter the size or shape. You will love using these handy hooks for all your favorite ornaments, including Santa ornaments, your baby’s first Christmas ornaments, glitter ornaments, and pet ornaments. Whether you go for classic baubles, minimalist decor, or something a bit more eclectic, these hooks will fit right in. You can even use them to make your own ornaments with your friends or family for a fun Christmas craft. They’re durable enough to use both inside and outside the house and can help you display all kinds of holiday decorations. They work great for attaching ornaments to trees in your yard or on the street. You can even decorate a trailer, truck, car, or RV with these versatile hooks. You can also use them to hang a garland wherever you want to add a touch of holiday greenery. They’re made with heavy-duty quality wire that won’t bend with regular use, making them perfect for hanging delicate ornaments on Christmas tree branches. You’ll be able to use them for family traditions year after year. Stock up now to always have some extra hooks on hand!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g3luwmsiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07ZTFZ241","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZTFZ241","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZTFZ241","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
