window.products.push({"id":360341,"name":"Ultra Comfortable Inflatable Travel Pillow – Portable, Lightweight, Super Compact Neck Support for Airplane, Car, and Train + FREE Travel Accessories ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A+B0H59oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take the discomfort out of traveling! From adventurous road trips, to exciting cross-country flights, traveling opens up the opportunity to explore the world around us. Unfortunately, it also opens up the opportunity for aches, pains, and exhaustion. Cramped, uncomfortable seats and long hours can make travel much more stressful than it needs to be! But with the Kululush inflatable travel pillow, you can finally enjoy the rest and relaxation that you deserve! Designed for maximum relaxation! Ergonomically designed to fit comfortably around your neck and on your shoulders, our neck pillow for airplane travel provides stabilization and prevents poor posture, both of which can impact your overall comfort, even when your trip is over. Our ultra soft pillow cover will help you drift easily to sleep, and can be thrown in the washing machine for quick cleaning. Plus, the built-in pump saves you from wasting time and energy blowing up the pillow yourself, so you can get to relaxing in a matter of seconds! The whole kit and caboodle! What relaxation kit would be complete without an eye mask and ear plugs? The FREE eye mask can be used as-is to block out light, or you can pop it in a freezer and use it to help eliminate any circles or puffiness that might appear around your eyes during travel. The FREE quality ear plugs are perfect for blocking out any offending noise, and can easily be stored in the FREE carrying case. Between these amazing bonus items and your travel pillow, you’ll be surprised at how comfortable and relaxing your travels can be! A family promise you can trust. Kululush is a family-owned company with a proven record of customer satisfaction, and we always back your purchase with our money back guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your travel pillow, send it back for a full refund. Get the super power to sleep anywhere and add one to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91A+B0H59oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kululush","source_asin":"B0794RQDTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0794RQDTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0794RQDTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
