window.products.push({"id":360391,"name":"Allmygold Yellow Platinum Dipped Long Stem Genuine Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xaYWTF8eL._AC_SL1385_.jpg","description":"This is a real rose (12\") trimmed in platinum. Each flower is picked fresh at the peak of its beauty, formed and crafted by hand (to remove thorns, extra leaves, petals, etc.) with a secret technique. You can still see the veins in the petals and leaves. It takes 3-6 months and more than 50 steps to complete one piece, making each one unique and meaningful. The rose comes in a beautiful red box and is the perfect way to show your everlasting love for your significant other. As part of the Birth Color Rose collection, this Snow White Rose represents the month of April. It's a great gift for Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, birthdays, anniversaries, and other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xaYWTF8eL._AC_SL1385_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allmygold","source_asin":"B00FP5W472","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FP5W472","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FP5W472","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":360392,"name":"Lolita Hand Painted Champagne Glass, Something Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713z7x9rdiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lolita's Something Blue Champagne Flute is great if you are looking for a little something blue. Because you don't want to be the one with something old. It holds the most preferred and favorite drink for when you have a reason to celebrate. The flute shaped glass holds 7-1/2-Ounce of your choice in bubbly. When shopping for partyware, a Girl's Night Out, or just the perfect gift, consider purchasing the variety of options in the Lolita collections provided by the Santa Barbara. Santa Barbara Design Studio features designs by Tracy 'Lolita' Yancy. This high quality glassware is a unique piece of art and comes individually gift boxed. Since 1976, it has been our mission to create beautifully designed, high-quality giftware products that you are inspired to give and want to keep. Our passion for finding the next wonderful product has translated into a broad line drawn from the works of talented and trendsetting designers. Santa Barbara Design creates products for every day in your home and kitchen and gifts for all occasions. Our goal is to provide unique gifts that recognize and commemorate each of these milestones with fun and original products that make you say \"WOW.\"To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, we make what we love and we love what we make. Today, many of the original handcrafted pieces produced by Santa Barbara Ceramic Design in the late 1970's and early 1980's have become sought after collector's items. Likewise, the beauty, high quality and precision with which the company creates its current glass and ceramic products may make them the collectibles of the next millennium.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713z7x9rdiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOLITA","source_asin":"B001U2K3NQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001U2K3NQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001U2K3NQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
