window.products.push({"id":360410,"name":"Splash Home Motto PEVA 4G Premium Plastic, Lightweight Liner with 12 Rustproof Metal Grommet Holes 70” W x 72” H, Heavy Duty Waterproof Shower Curtain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sxCcCPUmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your family safe and healthy with non-toxic PEVA shower liners. The greatest danger in your bathroom could be your new vinyl shower curtain. The EPA found poly vinyl chloride (PVC) products are laden with 108 volatile organic compounds and poisonous chemicals that emit toxic gas into the air which can persist for the first 28 days. PVC plastic is softened with hormone-disrupting phthalates and includes chlorine which creates dioxin, a carcinogenic chemical formed during its creation and destruction. Dioxin is dangerous since it easily penetrates the food chain of the planet as it can travel widely without breaking down. A recent study found that in just six hours after opening a PVC shower curtain, your bathroom would be exposed to volatile organic compounds over 16 times the allowable levels for indoor air quality established by the US Green Building Council and the Washington State Indoor Air Quality Program. Bottom Line: Be wise and don't put your family at risk with poly vinyl chloride (PVC) shower curtains. Keep your bathroom clean and dry with the 4 Gauge PEVA Shower Curtain liner from Splash Home. The Shower Curtain Liner is 100% waterproof and does not need a liner to it. The length of this curtain makes it perfect for standard ceilings and keeps water in the shower or tub and not on your floor! Splash Home will make it more calm and less clutter. Splash Home's PEVA Shower Curtain is anything but ordinary. The unique graphic lends standout style to your bathroom décor and is made of 100% PEVA and is waterproof, Non-Toxic, No Chemical Odors, PVC-free, and is 72 x 70 Inches. For easy care, simply wipe clean with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sxCcCPUmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Splash Home","source_asin":"B07FW89C5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FW89C5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FW89C5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
