window.products.push({"id":360633,"name":"78\" Heirloom Quality Wooden Timeline Growth Ruler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21qJIksvNbL.jpg","description":"The wooden rulers are cut and molded from select Sugar Maple, a beautiful species selected for its superior strength, stability and appearance. Numerals and markings that appear on the face of each rule are not printed superficially on the surface; instead they are meticulously engraved deep into the body of the rule and then hand-filled with pigment to create permanent graphics. Inlaid end caps are machined from solid brass and are carefully fit, flush-mounted and pinned to each end of the ruler. Finally, the entire rule is sealed and then rubbed to a beautiful satin luster. The finished rules are heirloom quality, and each will develop its own character and coloring as it ages, becoming more beautiful with the passage of time. A wonderful family keepsake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21qJIksvNbL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skowhegan Wooden Rule","source_asin":"B002N5SMPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002N5SMPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002N5SMPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":360634,"name":"LANUEVA Grain Mill Grinder, 700g High Speed Spice Grinder Electric, 2500W Wheat Flour Mill Pulverizer for Dry Corn Rice Pepper Coffee Beans Herb (110V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":122.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q4EU9T6bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOME USE GRAIN MILL Perfect for grind dried ingredients into fine powder. Commonly used for grains like wheat berries/ dry beans/ barley/ corn/ rice/ Teff grains/ rye, spices and seasonings like Nutmeg/ cinnamon stick/ dried peppers and chilli/dried fennel and aniseed, coffee beans and seeds. HIGH SPEED & EFFECTIVE GRINDING The wheat grinder is powered by a 2500W commercial fine copper motor and with durable stainless steel blades, it takes only 30-60 seconds to get fresh flour. There is no adjustment to directly set the coarse level, THE LONGER YOU RUN THE GRINDER THE FINER THE GRIND. The grinding degree is 50-300 mesh. DUAL SAFETY PROTECTION With the safety switches on the both sides, the power will be cut off immediately to avoid cutting your fingers when the lid is opened. Besides, the overload protector on the base will pop up to cut off the power when blades are jammed or mill is overloaded. CHAMBER WITH MARK & EASY TO USE Put dried grains into the chamber and it should cover the blades and not exceed the \"MAX\" mark position. Close the lid and MAKE SURE TO TOUCH THE SAFETY SWITCHES, then easily start milling by turning timer switch to the time you need. You’d better run it for NO MORE THAN 3 MIN at a time and let grinder cool 5-10 min to well care the motor. EASY TO CLEAN The mill chamber are NOT DETACHABLE for cleaning, please brush out powder with cleaning brush first, then clean the inside with dry cloth or air duster. Keep water away from the grinding chamber, main body and base. If you clean the blades by using wet cloth or water, dry the chamber and blades totally before re-installing blades.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q4EU9T6bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANUEVA","source_asin":"B0BMWRL859","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMWRL859","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMWRL859","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
