window.products.push({"id":360693,"name":"Lantoo Automatic Soap Dispenser, Touchless Hands Free Liquid Dish Soap Dispenser Stainless Steel for Bathroom & Kitchen, 280ML, Upgraded Waterproof Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KhzEySwlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Attention Please: This stainless steel soap dispenser(Model 4) is an automatic liquid soap dispenser. If prefer a foam soap dispenser, please choose the white Model 1 dispenser! Specification: Material: Stainless steel PC & ABS plastic Capacity: 280ml/9.56oz Sensor Range: 0-6cm/0-2.36in Dispensing Volume: 0.5-4ml/0.02-0.14oz Power Supply: 4x AAA Alkaline Battery (not included) Product Dimensions: 7.9x 4.1x 3.5 inches How To Use Automatic Soap Dispenser: 1.Remove the battery cover and insert 4 new AAA batteries into the bottom battery compartment. Put the cover back. 2.Twist the container lid anti-clockwise and open the cover gently. 3.Fill the reservoir with liquid soap,about three quarter of it(tank is 9.56oz capacity). Close it tight. 4.Swith on: press and hold the + button for 2-3 seconds (Red light will flash twice). 5.Swith off: press and hold the – buttoon for 2-3 seconds (Indicate light off). 6.Adjust the soap liquid volume: Press + or – button once for a level, total 4 levels of soap liquid volume. 7.Put your hand under the sensor to let the dispenser start to work. If the pump makes a pumping sound, but there is nothing, any advice for this? 1. Please place your finger over the spout and activate the motor 8 more times, then remove your finger and activate the dispenser until the water starts to pump through. 2. If the above are still not helpful, please try to change to fill the container with some warm water(40-60℃) and repeat the above step. Package Includeds: 1x Automatic Soap Dispenser 1x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KhzEySwlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lantoo","source_asin":"B07J2YRBXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J2YRBXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J2YRBXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
