window.products.push({"id":360707,"name":"Jebao PP399 264GPH With Round Light Outdoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21C5dAq5jsL._AC_.jpg","description":"PUMP INFO: Suitable Locations: Indoor's & Outdoors This pump is a High Quality Pump. That has the highest ratings in its class Engineered for reliability, performance. High quality down to the shaft. Includes either the strongest Polished Stainless Steel or ceramic Impeller Shaft. This is the heart of the pump and is to insures long and quiet pump life. This pump incorporates a magnetic wet-rotor design, so there is no seal to fail that would damage the pump motor. WARNING: This pump is UL listed for your protection!! Make sure you do not buy the cheap Pumps that are not going to protect you from electrical shock. Any time you have water and electricity mixing together Death may occur. Please do not save yourself a dollar and put you or a family member or someone else at risk. Long lasting Pump design! Efficient: Neodymium Iron Boron (NdFeB) Magnets are used in all our electric motors because they are the most powerful permanent magnetic materials commercially available and increase energy efficiency. All the key internal motor components have been encased in an Epoxy Resin to prevent unwanted conductivity and corrosion of metal parts. Water- Lubricated Nitrile Bushings are used because they possess a very low coefficient of friction, have inherent vibration-dampening qualities and are non-polluting. These pumps are designed for Fresh water only. This model has a high quality waterproof cord. Our SJTW Electric Cord is waterproof, quality copper wire, molded plug with ground, heavy duty flexible vinyl jacket, resists oil/grease/moisture, abrasion resistant and very good flexibility at all temperatures. Safe & Easy: Safe for fish, animals and plants with no exposed copper and oil free. Easy to clean with no tools required to disassemble and clean filter/impeller. If you want a Durable, Quality pump buy this now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21C5dAq5jsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jeboa","source_asin":"B00NQGKIT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NQGKIT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NQGKIT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
