window.products.push({"id":360745,"name":"Joyhill Measuring Cups and Spoons Set of 10 Piece, Stainless Steel Measuring Cups with Soft Touch Silicone Handles, Nesting Metal Measuring Cups for D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mpgA7YF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【Professional Kitchen Measuring Set】: The amount of seasoning is crucial to the success of a delicious dish or dessert. Joyhill's metal measuring cups and spoons Set have ten different capacities, each engraved precise measuring accurate in US and metric units of 1 Cup 250ml、1/2 Cup 125ml、1/3 Cup 80ml、1/4 Cup 60ml、1/8 Cup 30ml; 1 TBSP 15ml、1/2 TBSP 7.5ml、1 TSP 5ml、1/2 TSP 2.5ml、1/4 TSP 1.25ml which will help you reduce any measuring errors for cooking, baking or coffee, get delicious food！ 👍【High Quality】: Joyhill's metal measuring cups and measuring spoons set is 100% made from food-grade extra thick stainless steel which is copper-plated, rust-resistant, non-toxic and odorless, in line with national food safety regulations, sturdy and durable. The smooth surface polishing process leaves no food or liquid residue and no breeding space for bacteria. 👍【Keep Your Kitchen Clean& Tidy】: Stackable measuring cups & measuring spoons nest inside another for saving kitchen space. Detachable clip rings which makes measuring cups and spoons easy to organize and store in the drawer, or hang on a kitchen hook. It is sleek and classy, when not in use, you can hang them on your kitchen wall as decorations. 👍【Must-Have Kitchen Gadgets】: The ergonomic handle is thickened to accommodate the weight required during the cooking process. Not easily deform. The spoons are made of foundry technology in one piece. And the welding between the body and the handle of measuring cups is very stable and durable. BPA-free silicone handle provides a better grip experience and prevent slippery. Help you stop wasting the seasoner and get a better cooking result. 👍【After-Sale Guarantee】: Joyhill has done thousands of research for the single-minded pursuit of a high-quality kitchen utensil. Joyhill's Kitchen utensils are designed from the perspective of pragmatism and have passed several project quality tests before selling. If you have an unexpected quality issue, it is our honor to hear your valuable advice. We will provide you with the best solution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mpgA7YF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYHILL","source_asin":"B0B24SZVHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B24SZVHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B24SZVHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
