window.products.push({"id":360752,"name":"Interior Decorations for Table Set, Wedding Centerpieces Candle Holder for Party, Bridal, Baby Showers (Purple, Small)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WC5H0Nj4L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"West End Studios Glass Candle Holder is beautiful in vibrant color that will jazz up your candles. The unique glass candle holder brings a style and elegance for nearly every decor! They feature artistic flair unique to each design. Each centerpiece is hand made in the USA from decorative glass. No two are the same. They hold a candle of up to 2 to 2.5 inches wide or smaller. When you add a candle and light it, you will be amazed from the colors that shine through the art glass. The handmade process begins in our Ohio facility where we cut the glass to size and placed onto special designed molds. The molds are put into custom built kilns and slow heated to different temperatures based on size and color. During this process the art glass candle holder’s form their own personality. This is called mold slumping where we begin with a sheet of flat glass placed above a ceramic mold. When slow heated for many hours, the glass slumps into the mold under its own weight. Once out of the kiln, the glass is cooled for many hours. Once cooled, the final step is cleaning which results in the finished art glass candle holder. The candle holders make an attractive decorative vase for flowers, potpourri, or fill with Valentine candy and impress your girlfriend on Valentine’s Day. The Candle holders are available in many colors, perfect for wedding centerpiece table sets, housewarming, or holiday and Christmas parties. Give as a gift to mom for Easter or mother’s day. Small glass candle holders weighs 11 oz, with a height of 5 inches and width of 7 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WC5H0Nj4L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West End Studios","source_asin":"B00YHL2OWU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YHL2OWU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YHL2OWU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
