window.products.push({"id":360910,"name":"Digging Dolls: 4 lbs Natural 12 Stone Madagascar Rough Stone Mix - Large Size - 1\" to 1.5\" Average - Raw Rough Rocks for Arts, Crafts, Tumbling, Polis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lhGA9BTeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Digging Dolls Brand of stones is owned by female rock hounds who care deeply about providing only the best quality and value with the most spectacular 100% natural stones on the market. When you order any authentic Digging Dolls product you can be certain that every order has been through a rigorous quality control process and only the best products are allowed to feature our Digging Dolls logo.This Madagascar rough stone mix was specially designed by the Dolls to contain the perfect mix of colors, patterns, and beauty for our customers. We realize there are many stone mixes to choose from and Digging Dolls has been very careful to create a captivating mix with only high quality stones that can be used for arts, crafts, home decor, decoration, tumbling, wire wrapping, gem mining, lapidary, fountains, reiki and more. Once you have the stones in your hands the innovative thoughts for their uses just spring to mind!In each bag you will find all 12 of the following stone types: Amethyst, Apatite, Chrysocolla, Girasol Quartz, Green Opal, Labradorite, Petrified Wood, Polychrome Jasper, Red Jasper, Rose Quartz, Septarian and Yellow Jasper. Since these stone types are mixed at random in bulk it is possible to receive more than one piece of a stone type and not every stone type is guaranteed to be in each bag.Every stone is unique and you will not be receiving the exact stones in the pictures. As natural earth mined stones they will vary in size, color, shape and patterning. While most stones are 1\" to 1.5\" it is possible to get smaller or larger stones as part of your order. We do our best to show these variations in our images to make sure you are thrilled with what you receive when ordering the Digging Dolls brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lhGA9BTeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digging Dolls","source_asin":"B01N0ZJWKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0ZJWKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0ZJWKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":360911,"name":"Landing Party by Eric Joyner Wall Decor, 35 by 47\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wle6ea3uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a painting of four robots standing in front of giant doughnuts and flying saucers holding a flag with a picture of a doughnut on it. Eric attended the Academy of Art and the University of San Francisco and went on to establish himself as a commercial artist, creating illustrations for Mattel Toys, Levi's, Microsoft and Showtime. A member of both San Francisco's and New York's Society of Illustrators, Joyner is an instructor and speaker at several California institutions. His work has been featured in museums, galleries and cultural institutions worldwide. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wle6ea3uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B014A5VMHU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014A5VMHU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014A5VMHU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
