window.products.push({"id":360920,"name":"Sleepy Time Linens 1800 Series 6 Piece Beige King Sheet Set - King Size Sheets Tan - King Tan Sheets - WRINKLE FREE Super Soft Bed Sheets - 18\" Deep P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uZT92qFwL._AC_SL1023_.jpg","description":"The warm tone of these beige sheets will keep you calm and relaxed through your nights rest. These luxury sheets are smooth against your skin with an unparalleled softness and comfort that transform your bed into an oasis. The 1800 Series sheet set is incomparable in luxury. The sheets are stitched with deep pockets to fit even oversized mattresses. The fabric is 100% microfiber, which are synthetic fibers that feel and look like cotton sheets. They are lightweight, wrinkle free, extremely soft and long-lasting. They are far less expensive than pure cotton sheets, yet have superior comfort! The sheets are easy to care for. Simply, wash in cold/warm and tumble dry on low/warm. No ironing necessary. These sheets are designed to provide lasting vibrancy regardless of how often they are washed. Go ahead, treat yourself to the ultimate in feel, softness, and comfort! Passion. Energy. Bliss. Sleep. Repeat. King Size Flat Sheet 102 inch x 98 inch (259 cm x 267 cm) Fitted Sheet 78 inch x 80 inch (198 cm x 203 cm) 4 Pillowcases 20 inch x 40 inch (51 cm x 102 cm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uZT92qFwL._AC_SL1023_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepy Time Linens","source_asin":"B00RDG2UX4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RDG2UX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RDG2UX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":360921,"name":"Emile Henry Covered Rectangular Baker, Flour","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wJgt3oFmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since 1850, Emile Henry has produced in France a large range of high quality ceramic cooking utensils. our products are made from natural materials and have been designed and manufactured in France, in Southern Burgundy. Controlled production, without waste, is part of our daily commitment: the CO2 expelled from our workshops is particularly low thanks to our modern firing techniques that require less energy. The waste in General is recycled and the water used in production is filtered and used again in the production process. Our dishes have always been produced in France, in marcigny in the South of Burgundy: it is a tradition and savoir-faire which has been handed down from generation to generation. Each Worker prepares his moulds, produces his dishes and signs each one with his Initials. We are proud of this responsibility entrusted to each of our workers, which is a pledge of quality for all our production. This modern classic rectangular covered baker is thoughtfully crafted with a domed lid that is tight-fitting along the sides to circulate moisture while roasting poultry, braising meats and simmering stews..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wJgt3oFmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B07FV39DTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-360921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FV39DTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FV39DTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
